{"title":"1603.00285 Kernel-based Tests for Joint Independence","markdown":{"headingText":"1603.00285 Kernel-based Tests for Joint Independence","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Niklas Pfister, Peter Bühlmann, Bernhard Schölkopf, Jonas Peters；2016-03-01（v3 2016-11）；arXiv:1603.00285\n- **一句话定位**：把双变量 HSIC 推广为 d 变量联合独立性检验 dHSIC——将联合分布与边缘乘积嵌入再生核希尔伯特空间（RKHS）后取平方距离——并基于 V-统计量渐近理论构造置换、自助法（bootstrap）与 Gamma 近似三种检验，严格证明其水平与一致性。\n- **研究问题**：如何非参数地检验 d 个（可为非连续、一般度量空间上的）随机变量 X^1,…,X^d 的联合独立 P_{X^1}⊗⋯⊗P_{X^d} = P_{(X^1,…,X^d)}？成对独立性检验不充分，逐对检验加 Bonferroni 保守、不对称且计算贵 d 倍。\n- **模型与方法**：Setting 1：各变量空间为可分度量空间，各配连续有界正定核 k^j，要求张量积核 k=k^1⊗⋯⊗k^d 为特征核（characteristic kernel，如高斯核），保证均值嵌入 Π 单射。**Definition 2.3**：dHSIC := ‖Π(P_{X^1}⊗⋯⊗P_{X^d}) − Π(P_{(X^1,…,X^d)}))‖_H²；**Proposition 2.4**：dHSIC=0 ⟺ 联合独立。估计量 d̂HSIC_n（Definition 2.6）是核函数三组期望项的 V-统计量组合，可写成单一核函数 h（式 2.4，2d 元）的 V-统计量（Lemma 2.7）。Kankainen (1995) 的特征函数法是其特例（Bochner 定理给出的平稳核且密度可分解），dHSIC 还支持图、字符串等核。检验统计量取 n·d̂HSIC_n，阈值分别由置换重排（各变量独立重排指标）、bootstrap 重抽样与 Gamma 分布近似确定。\n- **主要命题/定理**：**Theorem 3.1**（H_0 下渐近分布）：ξ_2(h)>0 且 n·d̂HSIC_n → (2^d/2)∑λ_i Z_i²，其中 λ_i 是核 h₂ 决定的积分算子 T_{h₂} 的特征值；证明依赖退化 V-统计量渐近分布（附录 C 新结果：Theorem C.5/C.6/C.9/C.13 等，含 ξ_2(h)>0 的证明——此点在 Gretton et al. 2007 中被隐含假设）。**Theorem 3.3**：H_A 下 n·d̂HSIC_n 依概率发散。**Proposition 3.5**：置换检验具有有限样本有效水平（valid level，含 Monte-Carlo 近似版本）。**Theorem 3.8/3.9**：bootstrap 检验具有逐点渐近水平，且对任意固定备择一致（渐近功效为 1）——首个具有此保证的可行核联合独立性检验。**Proposition 3.10/3.11**：Gamma 近似的均值与方差展开（该检验无理论保证但计算最快、小 d 时表现好）。实验：水平/功效/运行时模拟（Simulation 3 单边 d=4 利于逐对 HSIC、Simulation 4 稠密 DAG 利于 dHSIC，m=1000 次重复；大 d 时 HSIC 与 BMR-C 方法失效）；因果发现应用（5.2 节）：对加性噪声模型 X^j = ∑_{k∈PA_j} f_{j,k}(X^k) + N^j（非线性时 DAG 可辨识），提出\"DAG 验证法\"——GAM 回归各节点于其父节点得残差，用 dHSIC 检验 (res_1,…,res_d) 联合独立，不拒绝则不拒绝该 DAG；附录 E 证明残差估计误差不破坏 d̂HSIC 的渐近排序（Theorem E.2），样本分裂可得渐近有效 p 值。真实数据（海拔—日照—温度，Mooij et al. 2016 benchmark）：dHSIC 能在极小显著性水平下拒绝所有错误 DAG，而 HSIC 与 BMR-1000 不能（如错误方向 Sunshine→Altitude 未被拒绝）。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：联合噪声独立性是结构方程模型/加性噪声模型可辨识性的核心约束，dHSIC 把它变成可检验假设，直接服务于基于残差独立的因果发现（RESIT、CAM 的模型检验、因果假设检验）；同时是 ICA 与广义独立性度量研究的工具，附 R 包 dHSIC（CRAN）。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1603.00285.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"